            <h3 class="header-2 text-3xl aero">Physical</h3>
            <div class="p-4">
              <ul class="list-disc">
                <li>Genderless, no sexual / reproductive organs
                whatsoever.</li>
                <li>It stands at 6 feet even, and has a crooked
                tail spanning roughly five and a half feet.</li>
                <li>Its ears span roughly one and a half feet
                tall.</li>
                <li>It is lithe, weighing only around 135LBS /
                61KG.</li>
                <li>Messy, shoulder-length, unkept dark hair.
                Sometimes draped over and covering one eye.</li>
                <li>Like other Leukos Arsenikon Cruxes, alchemical
                symbol for white arsenic appears as a marking on
                its chest fluff.</li>
                <li>Its eyes are coated in a film of luciferin that
                gives it a bright sky blue glow.</li>
                <li>Often wears loose-fitting clothing.</li>
                <li>Wears a collar around its neck.</li>
                <li>Capable of consuming poison.</li>
              </ul>
