                <li>Rowdy is a Crux, a race of inter-dimensional
                beings often summoned from different periods and
                places. It isn't clear why it was brought to Earth
                in the spring of 2010 only to be left alone in the
                world and fend for itself. The curiosity is there,
                but the voices in its head can't agree on what the
                proper path forward is, so it chooses to just live
                in the moment instead.<br>
                <br>
                Skilled with technology and driven by curiosity,
                this creature spends its time learning and
                experimenting as it can, making friends along the
                way with those who share its interests and
                passions.</li>
                <li>Rowdy believes it was summoned using a wolf pup
                as a vessel</li>
                <li>It was absolutely no lead on who brought it
                here, but speculates it was a group of naysayers
                who didn't believe their grimorium was authentic
                and ran away once they realized what they had
                done.</li>
